    "html": "<section data-ui-unit=\"booking\">\n  <div class=\"booking-host\">\n    <h3 class=\"booking-host-title\">틈 도자기 스튜디오</h3>\n    <p class=\"booking-host-subtitle\">재료와 도구 포함 · 완성품 소성 후 수령</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"booking-action-row\">\n    <button id=\"favorite\" class=\"booking-icon-btn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"수업 찜하기\" aria-pressed=\"false\">\n      <img src=\"assets/icons/Heart.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\">\n    </button>\n    <button id=\"book\" class=\"booking-primary-btn\" type=\"button\">일정 선택하고 예약하기</button>\n  </div>\n  <p class=\"booking-note\">일정을 선택한 뒤 예약 내용을 확인할 수 있어요.</p>\n</section>",
    "css": "[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-host {\n  border-top: 1px solid #ededf0;\n  padding: 20px 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-host-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #202024;\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-host-subtitle {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #60606a;\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-action-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding-top: 20px;\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 600px) {\n  [data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-action-row {\n    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-icon-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  width: 48px;\n  height: 48px;\n  border: none;\n  background: transparent;\n  padding: 0;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-icon-btn img {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  display: block;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-icon-btn:hover {\n  background-color: #f4f4f6;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-icon-btn:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #5146d7;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-icon-btn[aria-pressed=\"true\"] img {\n  filter: invert(27%) sepia(98%) saturate(1000%) hue-rotate(270deg) brightness(1.1) contrast(1.1);\n}\n\n[data-ui-unit=\"booking\"] .booking-primary-btn {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  height: 52px;\n  background-color: #5146d7;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;\n